WEBVTT

00:12.887 --> 00:14.806
Itadori, why is his nose bleeding?

00:14.889 --> 00:15.724
What?

00:15.807 --> 00:16.683
I punched him.

00:16.766 --> 00:19.185
-When?
-At the very start.

00:19.269 --> 00:21.187
Did he touch you with his hand?

00:21.271 --> 00:22.188
Yes.

00:23.481 --> 00:26.192
My attacks have zero effect on him.

00:26.276 --> 00:28.111
What?

00:28.194 --> 00:30.572
-Why?
-The reason will come during the lecture.

00:30.655 --> 00:34.576
First, he may not be able
to use his ability on Itadori.

00:34.659 --> 00:38.121
Second, he has a reason
not to kill Itadori.

00:38.204 --> 00:40.248
Either way, it's an advantage.

00:40.749 --> 00:43.710
But I can stifle his movements.

00:45.378 --> 00:49.424
Let's create openings for each other
and take the opportunity to attack.

00:50.508 --> 00:52.927
We must exorcise him here.

00:55.180 --> 00:56.306
Okay!

01:03.605 --> 01:06.399
Be mindful of Yuji Itadori…

01:07.317 --> 01:10.528
and get rid of 7:3 Sorcerer first.

01:31.424 --> 01:34.093
I thought this was good.

01:34.177 --> 01:36.638
But they evaded my attacks.

01:36.721 --> 01:40.016
After they dodge it,
the tips of my needles will come off.

01:40.099 --> 01:41.851
It's only good for small fries.

01:42.352 --> 01:43.311
Let's stop this.

01:54.072 --> 01:56.157
Before he changes his shape…

01:56.241 --> 01:58.493
-He charges his cursed energy first!
-Very good.

02:00.245 --> 02:02.413
Even if I make myself smaller,

02:02.497 --> 02:05.708
I still risk getting killed
by Yuji Itadori in one blow.

02:05.792 --> 02:08.086
He's really my nemesis.

02:08.169 --> 02:10.630
Let's make him behave nicely.

02:12.507 --> 02:14.175
Transfigured humans.

02:14.759 --> 02:16.678
He still has some stored.

02:17.178 --> 02:19.013
Kill that short-haired brat.

02:27.397 --> 02:29.482
I knew it.

02:29.566 --> 02:31.609
That kid can't kill humans.

02:46.457 --> 02:48.960
Let's play…

02:57.385 --> 02:59.012
Please…

02:59.637 --> 03:01.472
Kill me…

03:05.894 --> 03:08.563
I want you to fight against him next.

03:08.646 --> 03:10.398
Will he cry this time?

03:10.481 --> 03:14.360
He's a foolish brat
who can't match ideal with reality.

03:14.444 --> 03:16.362
That's not true.

03:16.446 --> 03:19.949
He's on it right now.

03:20.033 --> 03:21.868
If anything,

03:21.951 --> 03:23.620
you're the foolish one.

03:30.293 --> 03:31.961
You killed them?

03:34.964 --> 03:36.883
His cursed energy level increased.

03:37.425 --> 03:39.719
I'll change my shape
right before the impact--

03:51.147 --> 03:53.775
There's no time for me
to make a substitute.

03:54.275 --> 03:56.110
What…

03:56.194 --> 03:59.280
What a fresh inspiration!

03:59.822 --> 04:01.032
Is this…

04:01.991 --> 04:03.201
death?

04:11.042 --> 04:12.835
I can do it now, right?

04:19.634 --> 04:21.552
Domain Expansion.

04:37.610 --> 04:39.821
Self-Embodiment of Perfection!

04:41.406 --> 04:42.699
Darn it.

04:44.701 --> 04:46.119
Now…

04:48.288 --> 04:50.039
I just want to thank you.

06:26.469 --> 06:27.637
Are you serious?

06:30.306 --> 06:32.809
Why was only Nanamin trapped inside?

06:32.892 --> 06:34.352
If this goes on…

06:34.435 --> 06:35.686
If this goes on…

06:40.191 --> 06:42.068
Domain Expansion.

06:42.151 --> 06:45.363
An enclosed space constructed
using cursed energy.

06:45.446 --> 06:49.367
A secret weapon that will enhance
the owner's strengths.

06:49.867 --> 06:53.496
It's the pinnacle of cursed techniques
that I couldn't reach.

06:54.455 --> 06:58.292
To use any cursed technique
which transfigures the soul,

06:58.376 --> 07:01.754
he probably needs to touch someone
with the palm of his original hand.

07:01.838 --> 07:05.049
But now that I'm inside his domain…

07:05.133 --> 07:10.096
I'm literally in the palm
of my opponent's hand.

07:11.639 --> 07:12.598
Darn it.

07:12.682 --> 07:15.143
Jujutsu Sorcerers are shit.

07:15.226 --> 07:18.187
Sometimes, we have to force our comrades

07:18.271 --> 07:21.107
to accept and sacrifice
their lives for others.

07:21.190 --> 07:22.942
That's why I quit.

07:23.943 --> 07:25.695
Or rather, I escaped.

07:27.572 --> 07:29.615
Do you like baguette sandwiches?

07:29.699 --> 07:30.533
What?

07:31.200 --> 07:32.160
What?

07:32.910 --> 07:35.288
You always buy this, right?

07:35.371 --> 07:37.248
Well, yes.

07:37.331 --> 07:40.042
The nearby convenience store
no longer sells it.

07:40.126 --> 07:42.753
Our bread's better than those
in convenience stores, right?

07:42.837 --> 07:45.256
I mean, this is a bakery.

07:45.339 --> 07:47.383
You're so mean.

07:48.926 --> 07:50.887
Please come again!

07:53.806 --> 07:55.016
A Fly Head.

07:56.559 --> 07:59.020
I guess it's fine to leave it alone.

08:00.021 --> 08:01.772
It will be trouble if I do a bad job

08:01.856 --> 08:03.649
and she thinks I'm some shady medium.

08:10.323 --> 08:12.283
How is it going?

08:12.366 --> 08:16.537
Giving us money
means giving us their lives.

08:16.621 --> 08:20.208
I don't need to talk much about
how to balance the benefits and risks.

08:20.291 --> 08:23.878
No need to do anything special
at the beginning.

08:23.961 --> 08:26.714
You just have to
face the clients sincerely.

08:26.797 --> 08:28.674
Don't forget this.

08:28.758 --> 08:29.926
Yes!

08:30.426 --> 08:31.928
Nanami.

08:32.011 --> 08:34.555
Don't make it sound so rigid.

08:34.639 --> 08:36.140
You'll scare the newbie.

08:36.641 --> 08:40.603
Newbie, your top priority
is the company's profit.

08:40.686 --> 08:43.439
This will also be our clients' benefits.

08:43.523 --> 08:47.109
Even persuading clients
to buy stocks that won't rise?

08:48.569 --> 08:52.990
This is the legitimate reward for us
who watch the market 24 hours a day.

08:53.074 --> 08:55.201
Isn't this your second year, Nanami?

08:55.284 --> 08:57.870
You're clever. You should let loose.

08:57.954 --> 08:59.413
I have high expectations of you.

09:00.373 --> 09:01.791
I'm a person

09:01.874 --> 09:03.834
who does not have a concept of

09:03.918 --> 09:06.170
what is worth doing,
and what is worth living for.

09:06.254 --> 09:09.632
I'll just earn some money
until I'm 30 or 40 years old,

09:10.132 --> 09:13.719
then I'll enjoy an aimless life
in a country with low cost of living.

09:14.595 --> 09:16.430
Four years after graduation,

09:16.514 --> 09:19.976
I think about money all the time.

09:20.685 --> 09:22.186
Curse or other human beings,

09:22.270 --> 09:24.564
I can stay away from them if I have money.

09:25.565 --> 09:26.440
Money.

09:27.066 --> 09:28.484
Money.

09:28.568 --> 09:29.944
Money.

09:31.028 --> 09:32.863
Money.

09:33.447 --> 09:35.157
As long as I have money.

09:36.367 --> 09:37.785
Are you okay?

09:38.369 --> 09:39.829
Have you been sleeping well?

09:40.830 --> 09:44.750
What about you? You look tired.

09:45.668 --> 09:47.211
You can tell?

09:47.795 --> 09:50.673
I feel that my shoulders
are quite heavy recently.

09:50.756 --> 09:52.883
Besides, I don't sleep well too.

09:54.218 --> 09:59.390
My job is to
let the rich entrust their money to me

10:00.016 --> 10:02.643
and make them richer.

10:02.727 --> 10:04.395
Something like that.

10:04.478 --> 10:07.940
To be honest,
no one will be sad even if I'm gone.

10:08.024 --> 10:11.485
But if the bakery is gone,
people who want to eat bread will be sad.

10:11.986 --> 10:16.240
But somehow, a job like mine
that's outside of such a human cycle

10:16.324 --> 10:19.869
gives me a better salary.

10:19.952 --> 10:22.913
It's quite strange when I think about it.

10:24.415 --> 10:27.084
-Are you showing off?
-No.

10:28.461 --> 10:31.505
I'm sorry.
It's quite hard for me to understand.

10:32.923 --> 10:35.092
Can you come forward a little?

10:35.885 --> 10:36.719
What?

10:40.348 --> 10:42.475
-What?
-How do you feel now?

10:42.558 --> 10:44.518
What? Let me see.

10:45.061 --> 10:46.729
What? It feels light!

10:46.812 --> 10:49.440
Go to the hospital if you still feel sick.

10:49.523 --> 10:50.941
I'll get going now.

10:52.151 --> 10:53.361
Oh, my!

10:53.444 --> 10:55.321
Wait!

10:55.404 --> 10:56.572
Wait!

10:56.656 --> 10:57.907
Excuse me.

11:00.117 --> 11:01.869
Thank you!

11:02.745 --> 11:04.789
Please come again!

11:04.872 --> 11:08.042
-"Thank you."
-Strange. Did he not hear me?

11:08.125 --> 11:09.502
Thank you!

11:09.585 --> 11:12.046
Please come again!

11:12.129 --> 11:16.842
I thought I had nothing to live for.

11:16.926 --> 11:17.760
SATORU GOJO

11:18.511 --> 11:20.638
Hello. It's Nanami.

11:20.721 --> 11:22.181
I would like to talk to you.

11:22.890 --> 11:23.766
Yes.

11:23.849 --> 11:25.935
I'll return to Jujutsu High tomorrow…

11:26.602 --> 11:28.187
Why are you laughing?

11:32.566 --> 11:33.901
Idle Transfiguration.

11:34.860 --> 11:36.237
I thank you.

11:40.908 --> 11:42.493
No need.

11:48.541 --> 11:51.502
I've received enough gratitude.

11:52.837 --> 11:54.255
I have no regrets.

12:09.061 --> 12:10.521
How did he enter?

12:11.730 --> 12:12.982
I see.

12:13.065 --> 12:15.651
The greater the barrier,

12:15.734 --> 12:18.070
the weaker it is to external attacks.

12:18.154 --> 12:21.740
Domain is only focused on closing.

12:22.241 --> 12:24.743
In other words,
it's easy for an invasion to happen.

12:25.494 --> 12:28.956
Because it brings no benefit
to the intruder.

12:30.458 --> 12:33.711
Even more so for the Unlimited Void
and Self-Embodiment of Perfection,

12:34.211 --> 12:39.216
whereby victory is confirmed
when the opponent is trapped inside.

12:41.218 --> 12:42.136
However,

12:42.720 --> 12:44.680
Itadori is an exception.

12:45.181 --> 12:47.892
There's something in him
that cannot be touched!

12:52.980 --> 12:54.565
I told you.

12:57.651 --> 12:59.820
No second chances.

13:05.159 --> 13:08.120
Everyone on earth
and in heaven must listen to him.

13:08.662 --> 13:12.583
He acts solely based on his mood.

13:13.167 --> 13:15.085
It's either you die…

13:15.753 --> 13:17.588
or I die.

13:18.214 --> 13:19.548
It doesn't matter.

13:20.841 --> 13:22.885
Except for that guy,

13:23.886 --> 13:26.805
I couldn't care less.

14:03.300 --> 14:05.469
What happened?

14:12.393 --> 14:14.311
I'll kill you!

14:14.395 --> 14:18.023
Domain Expansion has used up
too much cursed energy.

14:18.107 --> 14:20.943
It was my last resort.

14:21.026 --> 14:22.319
But that scoundrel, Sukuna…

14:22.403 --> 14:25.072
But this is the critical moment!

14:25.155 --> 14:26.949
Squeeze it out!

14:27.032 --> 14:28.659
The last of my cursed energy!

14:32.288 --> 14:33.831
The target is large.

14:34.331 --> 14:36.709
The flow of his cursed energy
is slowing down.

14:36.792 --> 14:38.460
There will be no counterattack.

14:39.044 --> 14:41.171
I can definitely attack him.

14:41.255 --> 14:42.923
It's my last chance.

14:45.217 --> 14:47.553
No need for tricks.

14:53.058 --> 14:54.727
Divergent Fist!

15:04.445 --> 15:06.488
What's going on?

15:06.572 --> 15:08.365
I felt nothing.

15:12.453 --> 15:15.956
-Wait!
-It was fun.

15:22.713 --> 15:26.300
Ino, the target has
escaped into the sewers.

15:27.092 --> 15:27.927
That's right.

15:28.510 --> 15:32.723
Please conduct a thorough search
of the direction southeast to my location.

15:32.806 --> 15:34.683
You should be able to exorcise him.

15:35.351 --> 15:37.186
We're going after him too!

15:38.687 --> 15:40.064
Itadori!

15:40.147 --> 15:41.941
Move, my body!

15:42.024 --> 15:44.568
Weren't you going to kill him?

15:45.152 --> 15:49.406
-I must crush him…
-Itadori!

15:49.490 --> 15:50.574
Itadori!

16:13.055 --> 16:14.723
That's the King of Curses,

16:14.807 --> 16:16.517
Ryomen Sukuna.

16:17.142 --> 16:21.105
His current cursed energy
is inferior to Jogo.

16:21.605 --> 16:22.731
However,

16:22.815 --> 16:24.817
his presence…

16:24.900 --> 16:27.236
His soul is on
a completely different level.

16:27.820 --> 16:29.738
I'm certain now.

16:29.822 --> 16:31.865
Even if we were wiped out,

16:31.949 --> 16:35.661
the era of curses can begin
as long as Sukuna is resurrected.

16:36.245 --> 16:38.747
But it's so troublesome.

16:38.831 --> 16:45.004
I really want to kill Yuji Itadori now!

16:48.799 --> 16:51.844
I'm feeling so impatient!

16:51.927 --> 16:53.804
But forget it.

16:53.887 --> 16:58.142
Unlike the body,
the soul can be killed many times.

16:59.977 --> 17:03.147
How should I kill him next time?

17:07.192 --> 17:09.570
Didn't I tell you to rest?

17:10.821 --> 17:12.197
Are you lecturing me?

17:12.781 --> 17:16.994
No lecturing needed for my savior.

17:17.745 --> 17:18.704
Me?

17:18.787 --> 17:23.000
Mahito's cursed techniques
can interfere with other people's souls.

17:23.500 --> 17:28.464
You made him touch Sukuna's soul
when you invaded his domain.

17:29.256 --> 17:30.924
Thanks to you, I'm saved.

17:32.301 --> 17:35.304
But I didn't switch.

17:36.430 --> 17:38.390
Sukuna didn't come out.

17:38.474 --> 17:40.684
Instead, Mahito went in.

17:41.769 --> 17:44.480
Then I wasn't the one who saved you.

17:44.563 --> 17:46.440
Sukuna did it on a whim.

17:47.232 --> 17:50.694
Nanami, I killed humans today.

17:51.779 --> 17:54.198
People will die. It's inevitable.

17:54.281 --> 17:56.825
But I want their deaths
to be justified, at least.

17:57.367 --> 17:59.119
That was what I was thinking.

17:59.620 --> 18:02.664
That's why I only think about
not pulling the trigger.

18:03.373 --> 18:07.711
But now that I pulled the trigger myself,
I don't understand it anymore.

18:08.504 --> 18:10.255
What's the right way to die?

18:10.339 --> 18:12.800
I don't know either.

18:13.300 --> 18:18.555
The good should die peacefully
and the bad should have a horrible death,

18:18.639 --> 18:21.850
but most people are neither good nor evil.

18:22.351 --> 18:26.396
I believe that all deaths
come to all people differently,

18:26.480 --> 18:30.067
and giving proper guidance
to all the souls is just tiring.

18:30.150 --> 18:32.069
I don't recommend you to do that.

18:33.403 --> 18:37.032
Even so, you'll still try to do it.

18:38.242 --> 18:40.327
Just be careful not to die.

18:40.410 --> 18:44.081
If you weren't there today,
I would've died.

18:44.164 --> 18:47.793
People who rely on you
will start to appear…

18:48.418 --> 18:52.339
since you're already
a Jujutsu Sorcerer, Itadori.

18:57.594 --> 19:00.681
Put it in the box when you're done.

19:00.764 --> 19:02.516
You don't need to write your names.

19:02.599 --> 19:04.226
QUESTIONNAIRE ON BULLYING

19:24.121 --> 19:28.625
So it's you who injured Yoshino, Ito.

19:29.376 --> 19:32.671
I don't want to be scolded by the one

19:32.754 --> 19:35.340
who's too afraid to do anything
at that time.

19:36.175 --> 19:38.719
He's quit school and moved away, right?

19:38.802 --> 19:40.262
Can't we forget about it?

19:41.263 --> 19:42.347
By the way,

19:42.431 --> 19:45.601
my left hand can't move since then.

19:45.684 --> 19:48.395
I'm asking about your crime.

19:48.478 --> 19:51.607
Think of that injury
as your punishment and reflect on it.

19:51.690 --> 19:53.358
What about your punishment?

19:53.442 --> 19:55.402
It's coming.

19:55.485 --> 19:58.822
I want to take a good look
at the things I didn't see clearly.

19:59.948 --> 20:02.367
Whether it's me or you…

20:02.951 --> 20:06.955
We'll carry the sin
of ruining Junpei's heart forever.

20:07.456 --> 20:10.375
I'll be watching you, Ito.

20:16.006 --> 20:18.800
I still don't know
the meaning of a justified death.

20:19.426 --> 20:20.469
Then at least…

20:22.346 --> 20:23.305
Before I understand…

20:27.267 --> 20:29.228
Before I kill that guy…

20:40.030 --> 20:41.782
I will never…

20:44.243 --> 20:45.535
lose again.

22:16.543 --> 22:17.919
Juju Stroll.

22:22.466 --> 22:23.884
Can we eat now?

22:23.967 --> 22:24.968
Salmon.

22:32.142 --> 22:33.852
This meatball is delicious.

22:33.935 --> 22:34.811
Who made it?

22:34.895 --> 22:36.563
It's me.

22:36.646 --> 22:38.231
You can make it easily.

22:38.315 --> 22:41.651
1. PUT IN ALL THE INGREDIENTS
AND USE DOUBLE THE AMOUNT OF GINGER

22:41.735 --> 22:44.946
2. MIX AND KNEAD WELL

22:45.030 --> 22:49.618
3. SHAPE MEATBALLS WITH A SPOON
AND PLACE THEM INTO THE POT

22:49.701 --> 22:52.496
INGREDIENTS: CHICKEN MEAT,
MINCED SPRING ONIONS, GINGER SAUCE

22:52.579 --> 22:54.998
EGG YOLKS (YOU CAN INCLUDE EGG WHITES)
SALT AND PEPPER

22:55.582 --> 22:56.750
Leaf mustard.

22:57.751 --> 23:00.170
So Fushiguro can cook.

23:00.253 --> 23:01.379
I'm not surprised.

23:02.089 --> 23:05.008
No, Itadori taught me how to make it.

23:15.143 --> 23:16.686
I see.

23:18.271 --> 23:20.816
Itadori's posthumous work.

23:20.899 --> 23:22.526
That doesn't sound right.

23:25.487 --> 23:27.614
This meatball is so delicious.

23:27.697 --> 23:28.657
They are.

23:28.740 --> 23:30.408
You can make it really easily.

23:32.327 --> 23:35.413
Fushiguro can make it too
since I taught him.

23:38.625 --> 23:41.294
I want to see them soon.
